<title>USA: NY precious metals called to open lower.</title>
<headline>NY precious metals called to open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York precious metals futures were called to open lower Friday, with the bullion market giving back more of the week's rally overnight.</p>
<p>COMEX December gold was called down $0.50 to $1.00 from Thursday's close of $381.80 an ounce. It traded from $380.20 to $380.30 on ACCESS.</p>
<p>COMEX gold stocks rose 97 ounces Thursday to 1,073,382 ounces.</p>
